sh and provide these details. I understand that access requires provincial approval.</span></label><button class="primary">Submit registration for review →</button><p class="small muted">Already approved? <a class="text-link" href="?page=login">Sign in to your church account</a></p></form><?php endif ?></main><aside class="registration-aside"><p class="eyebrow">FAITHFUL STEWARDSHIP, SIMPLIFIED</p><h2>More clarity.<br>Less paperwork.<br>One purpose.</h2><p>Report Youth Thanksgiving offerings, see your exact allocation and keep every remittance in one place.</p><div class="aside-check">✓ &nbsp; Automatic offering calculation</div><div class="aside-check">✓ &nbsp; Track payment confirmations</div><div class="aside-check">✓ &nbsp; Protected church bank details</div></aside></body></html>
